  "family_id": "bridgmanite",
  "cell_contents": "Four nominal Mg0.95Al0.10Si0.95O3 formula units per conventional orthorhombic bridgmanite cell (Z=4). The stored atom_sites are an explicitly identified MgSiO3 Pbnm positional-topology proxy and do not encode an experimentally refined Al distribution.",
